    <Major></Major>
    <Description>Macro for the game "Locked" on Roblox. The macro kicks the ball into the air, walks forward, jumps, and kicks the ball in whatever direction you're facing. It'll miss sometimes, it's dependent on ping. 800 dpi and .171 Roblox Sensitivity are required, 1920x1080p is used but you can use any resolution since mouse move is relative.</Description>
